eply_reopen.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/gmail_archive_merge_and_reply_reopen.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-lk[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-lk/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Follow merge edges and surface remaining holds[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]merge-follow[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]merge-follow: resolve each merged-into source to its target task through[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the shared relation resolver. Archive evidence then uses those effective[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]linkers. Section tombstones count as closed. Unresolved merges and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unknown statuses become alert-once archive[] review rows plus a doctor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]count.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Line-shift-proof archive confirmation identity[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]digest-identity[dim] · [dim][/dim]after merge-follow[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]digest-identity: the -c digest and fresh_matches_close match tasks by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block id or row-text hash instead of line number, with DIGEST_VERSION 2 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and tolerant parsing of legacy locators. It also notes the fix on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-kx.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reopen closed Gmail Tasks when a reply arrives[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]reply-reopen[dim] · [dim][/dim]after merge-follow[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reply-reopen: a recent-activity search and fold of closed enrolled [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]threads. A new counted reply or bounce saves the message, then reopens [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the chosen linker (in place, or restored from done/). It lifts any [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]awaiting hold, resurfaces the task, records a link to the reply card, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and appends the turn marker. Adds config, reports, JSON, docs, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glossary fix.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-lk","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-lk.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-829645ec8b7c97daf4b0f6118d6c6111","started_at":"2026-11-14T17:16:17.572384+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"638ad5c98c44a3d048b7501410ff03063a8583ff4c8cee69c40eff1369d4646e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lk.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b9b0f20f84297d26ff75a32e753a7a8e9facb97685335a65e1d4362766bdad84","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lk.3/meta.json","size_bytes":689},"prompt":{"digest":"67524da0581430b2937aff48d64f5e1e5649ae5e38ad04a6e470c497a18e36e3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lk.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":181},"state":{"digest":"29c74cfd85be98d7a5064273b9fb439125e08eeb56e7491ef31bf4836bd97e7f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lk.3/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-lk.3","local_name":"bob-cli-lk.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-lk","agent_clan_generation":"20261114121441","bead_id":"bob-cli-lk.3","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-lk","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-lk.3","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHu